Data sources
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Pokémon Showdown (https://github.com/smogon/pokemon-showdown)
  Game data for Pokémon Champions: species, moves, items, abilities, learnsets
  and battle rules from its "champions" mods.
  MIT License. Copyright (c) 2011-2026 Guangcong Luo and other contributors.

@pkmn/dex, @pkmn/data and @pkmn/mods (https://github.com/pkmn/ps)
  The Pokémon Showdown data above, packaged for JavaScript.
  MIT License. Copyright (c) 2020-2026 pkmn contributors.

Smogon University usage statistics (https://www.smogon.com/stats/)
  Monthly usage, sets, spreads and teammates for the Pokémon Champions formats.

Rule dates and announcements are credited where they are used, in
packages/data/manual/*.json, with the link and the date they were checked.

